# The browser engine (UI-5, CF-15; ADR 0027): Chromium from FreeBSD's packages, until our own
# Chromium build exists. Same format as desktop.third-party: `<name>-<version> <path>...`, paths
# inside the package; stage-dist.sh copies exactly these, with each package's license files.
#
# Only what the engine runs on: no chromedriver, mksnapshot or protoc (build tools), no mock
# Vulkan driver, US English only (other languages' resources are 115 MB). SwiftShader draws
# until the engine has a GPU (libEGL, libGLESv2 and libvk_swiftshader are Chromium's own).
#
# The lines after the marker line below are written by `os/freebsd/scripts/third-party.py
# update <this file>`: every library the lines above it link, from the packages they come from
# (the full dependency tree is 174 packages and 3.5 GB; what the engine links is 56 and 33 MB).
# After changing a line, or with --bump to take the catalog's current versions (CF-16: security
# fixes within 3 days), run it again.

chromium-154.0.8037.57_1  usr/local/share/chromium/chrome usr/local/share/chromium/chrome_100_percent.pak usr/local/share/chromium/chrome_200_percent.pak usr/local/share/chromium/resources.pak usr/local/share/chromium/resources usr/local/share/chromium/locales/en-US.pak usr/local/share/chromium/snapshot_blob.bin usr/local/share/chromium/v8_context_snapshot.bin usr/local/share/chromium/libEGL.so usr/local/share/chromium/libGLESv2.so usr/local/share/chromium/libvk_swiftshader.so usr/local/share/chromium/libvulkan.so usr/local/share/chromium/vk_swiftshader_icd.json usr/local/share/chromium/product_logo_48.png
# What a package's catalog says covers all its files; where the files we take are under a
# narrower license, it's corrected here (notices.py reads these lines; ADR 0027).
#license flac BSD3CLAUSE: libFLAC is under Xiph's BSD license; the GPL and GFDL cover flac's programs and manual, not shipped
#license gettext-runtime LGPL21+: libintl is LGPL-2.1-or-later; the GPL-3.0 covers gettext's programs, not shipped
#license libiconv LGPL21+: GNU libiconv's library is LGPL-2.1-or-later since 1.17; the GPL-3.0 covers the iconv program, not shipped

# NSS loads its crypto and certificate modules at run time, by name.
nss-3.131  usr/local/lib/libsoftokn3.so usr/local/lib/libfreebl3.so usr/local/lib/libfreeblpriv3.so usr/local/lib/libnssckbi.so usr/local/lib/libnssdbm3.so

# Emoji (reactions, people's messages): fontconfig falls back to Noto Color Emoji for any
# character Geist lacks. 10 MB; OFL-1.1, like Geist.
noto-emoji-2.051  usr/local/share/fonts/noto/NotoColorEmoji.ttf

